# the mod envelopes: ENV's pages Envelope, Filter, Filter env, Mod env 1, Mod env 2 on a synth (acid: its two, then the
# mod envelopes; a kit: none); their knobs attack, decay, sustain, amount; the SEL list's TARGET (only what the engine
# has), RELEASE, LOOP; a project saved and loaded keeps them; a user preset keeps them
wait 300
spin ALGO 2
expect trk 3
knob 3 engine knit
tap ENV
expect page Envelope
turn SELECT 3
expect page Mod_env_1
expect knobs m1a m1d m1s m1amt
spin K2 20
expect par3.m1d 84
spin K4 30
expect par3.m1amt 94
wait 50
shot menv_none.png
turn SELECT 1
expect page Mod_env_2
expect knobs m2a m2d m2s m2amt
turn SELECT 1
expect page Envelope
turn SELECT -1
expect page Mod_env_2
turn SELECT -1
expect page Mod_env_1
# the list: TARGET steps through knit's targets (rayon's depth skipped), RELEASE, LOOP
tap SEL
row TARGET
wait 50
turn ALGO 1
expect par3.m1tgt 1
wait 50
turn ALGO 1
expect par3.m1tgt 2
wait 100
shot menv_list.png
row LOOP
turn ALGO 1
expect par3.m1loop 1
tap SEL
wait 100
shot menv_wave.png
# kept: the project saved and the FM-1 restarted; a user preset (the packed presets object, format 18) and a kit beside it
knob 3 m2tgt 18
knob 3 m2amt 20
usersave 3 1
tap SAVE
wait 40
reboot
wait 300
expect par3.m1tgt 2
expect par3.m1d 84
expect par3.m1amt 94
expect par3.m1loop 1
expect par3.m2tgt 18
expect par3.m2amt 20
knob 3 m1tgt 0
knob 3 m2tgt 0
preset 3 U1
expect par3.m1tgt 2
expect par3.m2tgt 18
expect par3.m2amt 20
# acid: Envelope, Filter, then the mod envelopes
knob 3 engine acid
tap ENV
expect page Envelope
turn SELECT 2
expect page Mod_env_1
# a kit: its four pages, no mod envelope
knob 3 engine kit
tap ENV
turn SELECT 4
expect page Envelope
